  <para style="h">1 Korinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya mbere Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Korinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya mbere Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Korinto</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo nahamagariwe kuba intumwa ya Kristo Yesu bivuye ku gushaka kw’Imana, hamwe na mwene Data Sositene,<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Turabandikiye mwebwe abo mw’ishengero ry’Imana riri i Korinto, mwejejwe no kuba muri Kristo Yesu kandi mwahamagariwe kuba abera, hamwe n’abo bose bambaza izina ry’Umwami Yesu Kristo aho bari hose, bakamwambaza nk’Umwami wabo ari we Mwami wacu:<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese no ku Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo bibe muri mwebwe.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashima Imana ku bw’ab’i Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Nama nshima Imana ku bwanyu ku bw’ingabire y’ubuntu mwaherewe muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Muri we mwahawe ubutunzi mu buryo bwose, haba mu mvugo no mu bumenyi mufise. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ivyo vyerekana ko intahe ya Kristo twabashingiye yabaye ukuri muri mwebwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Ni co gituma ata ngabire n’imwe muhajije muri iki gihe mukirindiranye igishika uguhishurwa kw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Ni we azobaha gushikama gushika kw’iherezo, kugira ngo muzobe mutagira umugayo ku musi Yesu Kristo azogarukirako. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Imana yabahamagariye kunywana n’Umwana wayo Yesu Kristo Umwami wacu, ni iyo kwizigirwa, izobikora.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwirinda kwicamwo ibice</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Ndabinginga bene Data, mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, ngo muhuze muri vyose, kandi ntihabeho ukwicamwo ibice, ariko mutunganywe rwose muhuje umutima n’inama. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Bene Data, bamwe bo mu muryango wa Kilowe bambwiye ko hari imitongano muri mwebwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ico ngomba kuvuga ni iki: umwe muri mwebwe avuga ngo: “Jewe ndi umwigishwa wa Pawulo”; uwundi na we ati: “Jewe ndi umwigishwa wa Apolo”; uwundi na we ati: “Jewe ndi uwa Kefa”; hakaba n’uwundi avuga ati: “Jeho ndi umwigishwa wa Kristo gusa.”<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Mbega Kristo agabuwemwo ibice? Mbega Pawulo yarababambiwe? Mbega mwabatijwe mw’izina rya Pawulo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Ndashimira Imana ko ata n’umwe nabatije muri mwebwe kiretse Kirisipo na Gayo, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />nta n’umwe rero ashobora kuvuga ko yabatijwe mw’izina ryanje. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Egome narabatije n’abo mu muryago wa Setefana, ariko atari abo, sinibuka ko hari uwundi muntu n’umwe noba narabatije.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kuko Kristo ntiyantumye kubatiza, ariko yantumye kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza, ntakoresheje amajambo y’ubwenge bw’abantu, kugira ngo simpindure ubusa ubushobozi bw’umusaraba wa Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo ni we bwenge n’ubushobozi bw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Mu bisanzwe ubutumwa bw’umusaraba ni ubujuju ku bariko barahona, ariko kuri twebwe abariko barakizwa, ni ubushobozi bw’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Kuko handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Nzosangangura ubwenge bw’abanyabwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">n’ubumenyi bw’abiyita ko bazi vyinshi ndabuhindure ubusa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Yesaya 29:14</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />None umunyabwenge ari he? Umwigisha w’ivyagezwe ari he? Umusesanguzi w’amajambo w’iki gihe ari he? Mbega Imana ntiyafashe ubwenge bw’iyi si ikabuhindura ubujuju? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Kuko Imana mu bwenge bwayo yabonye ko ab’isi batoyimenya bakoresheje ubwenge bwabo, ni co gituma yahisemwo gukirisha abizera amajambo y’Ubutumwa Bwiza, ayo bamwe bita ubujuju. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Abayuda bashaka kubona ibimenyetso, Abagiriki na bo bakarondera kubitahurisha ubwenge bwabo. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Ariko tweho twigisha Kristo yabambwe: uwo ni igitsitaza ku Bayuda, n’ubujuju ku Banyamahanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Ariko ku bahamagawe, baba Abayuda canke Abagiriki, Kristo ni ubushobozi n’ubwenge vy’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Kuko ivyitwa ubujuju vy’Imana birusha ubwenge abantu kandi ivyitwa intege nke vy’Imana birusha inkomezi abantu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Bene Data, mwibuke uko mwari igihe mwahamagarwa. Benshi muri mwebwe ntimwari abanyabwenge dufatiye ku vyo abantu baraba. Benshi ntimwari abahambaye, kandi benshi ntimuvuka mu miryango ikomeye. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ariko Imana yahisemwo ivy’ubujuju vy’iyi si kugira ngo imaramaze abiyita abanyabwenge, kandi yahisemwo ibinyantege nke vy’iyi si kugira ngo itetereze ibinyenkomezi. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Imana yahisemwo ibitagira ikimazi vy’iyi si n’ibikengerwa ndetse n’ibitariho kugira ngo ihindure ubusa ibiriho. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Ivyo yabikoze kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe agira ico yirata imbere y’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Imana ni yo yabagize umwe na Kristo Yesu, we yatubereye ubwenge buva ku Mana. Ni we kugororoka kwacu, ukwera kwacu kandi ni we ugucungurwa kwacu gukomokako. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Ni co gituma handitswe ngo: “Uwirata wese yirate ko yamenye Umwami Yesu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Yeremiya 9:24</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Bene Data, igihe naza iwanyu, sinaje mfise amajambo aryohoye arimwo ugushira amazinda, canke ubwenge bw’abantu mu kubamenyesha ibanga ry’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Kuko nahisemwo kutagira ikindi mvuga igihe nari kumwe namwe, atari Yesu Kristo wenyene, umwe yabambwa ku musaraba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Naje iwanyu ndi umunyantegenke, mfise ubwoba kandi mpinda agashitsi. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Ubutumwa bwanje n’ukwigisha kwanje ntivyarimwo ubwenge bwinshi n’amajambo yo kwemeza abantu, ariko yagaragaramwo ubushobozi bwa Mpwemu Yera, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />kugira ngo ukwizera kwanyu ntiguhagarare ku bwenge bw’abantu, ahubwo guhagarare ku bushobozi bw’Imana.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwenge buva kuri Mpwemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Ariko ku bakuze mu kwizera, ubutumwa tuvuga ni ubw’ubwenge: ubwo bwenge si ubw’iki gihe canke ubw’abatware b’iki gihe bazokurwaho. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ahubwo tubabwira ubwenge bw’Imana bwari bwaragizwe ibanga, bwari bwaranyegejwe, ariko Imana ikaba yari yabuduteguriye isi itararemwa kugira ngo buzoduhe ubwiza. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Nta n’umwe wo mu baganza b’iki gihe yigeze abutahura, kuko iyo baba barabutahuye, ntibaba barabamvye Umwami w’ubwiza. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ivyanditswe bivuga biti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Ibintu ata jisho na rimwe ryigeze kubibona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">ibintu ata gutwi na kumwe kwigeze kuvyumva,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">kandi ibintu ata bwenge bw’umuntu n’umwe bwigeze kuvyiyumvira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">ni vyo Imana yateguriye abayikunda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Yesaya 64:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ariko ivyo nyene ni vyo Imana yaduhishuriye biciye muri Mpwemu wayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:10">Mpwemu asesangura vyose, mbere n’ibihishijwe vy’amabanga y’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nk’uko ata wushobora kumenya ivyiyumviro vy’umuntu atari impwemu yiwe, nta n’uwushobora kumenya ivyiyumviro vy’Imana atari Mpwemu wayo. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Kandi ntitwahawe impwemu y’iyi si, ariko twahawe Mpwemu ava ku Mana, kugira ngo dutahure ivy’akaburarugero Imana yaduhereye ubuntu. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Ivyo tubabwira ntitubivugisha ubwenge bw’abantu, ariko tubabwira ivyo duhawe na Mpwemu, tukabivuga mu kuri kwa Mpwemu, dukoresheje n’amajambo duhawe na Mpwemu. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Umuntu adafise Mpwemu ntashobora kwakira ibiva kuri Mpwemu w’Imana, kuko bisa n’ubujuju kuri we, kandi ntashobora kubitahura kuko bisesangurwa biciye muri Mpwemu. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Abantu bafise Mpwemu Yera basesangura vyose ariko bo nta wusesangura ivyabo, <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />kuko handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Ni nde yigeze amenya ivyiyumviro vy’Uhoraho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">kugira ngo amugire inama?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Yesaya 40:13</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Ariko tweho turabitahura kuko dufise ivyiyumviro vya Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo agwanya amacakubiri mw’ishengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Bene Data, igihe nari kumwe namwe sinabigishije nk’uko nokwigisha abantu bakuze mu Mpwemu, nabigishije nk’abantu basanzwe bo mw’isi, nk’abana bato mu vy’ukwizera Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Nabahaye amata, sinabahaye ivyokurya bigumye, kuko ntimwari bwagere kubishobora, kandi n’ubu ntimurabishobora. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Muracagendera mu ngeso zanyu za kera zo mw’isi kuko muracagiriranira ishari kandi muracatongana. None ivyo ntivyerekana ko mukigendera mu ngeso zanyu za kera? Mbega ntimubayeho nk’abandi bose batizera? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Iyo umwe muri mwebwe avuze ati: “Jewe ndi umwigishwa wa Pawulo,” uwundi ati: “Nanje ndi umwigishwa wa Apolo,” ntimuba muriko mwigenza nk’ab’iyi si?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Mbega Apolo ni iki, canke Pawulo ni iki? Ni abakozi b’Imana basanzwe babafashije mu gushika ku kwizera nk’uko Imana yakoresheje umwumwe wese muri bo. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Jewe nabivye imbuto, Apolo na we arazivomera, ariko Imana ni yo yazikujije. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />None rero, yaba uwabivye, yaba uwavomeye, bompi nta co bamaze. Imana yonyene ikuza ni yo ihambaye. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Uwubiba n’uwuvomera bompi bafise intumbero imwe, kandi umwe wese azoherwa impera ku gikorwa yakoze, <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />kuko twempi dukorera Imana, namwe muri umurima w’Imana, muri inzu yayo.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kubera ubuntu nagiriwe n’Imana, nashizeho urufatiro nk’umwubatsi w’umuhinga, hanyuma haza uwundi muntu arwubakako. Ariko uwurwubakako wese yiyubare uburyo arwubakako. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Kuko ata wushobora gushiraho urundi rufatiro atari urwo nashizeho, ari rwo Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Uwurwubakako wese ashobora gukoresha ibikoresho bitandukanye: inzahabu, ifeza, amabuye y’agaciro kanini, ibiti, ibishakashaka canke ivyatsi. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Ariko umusi w’imanza uzogaragaza igikorwa c’umwumwe wese kuko uzohishuranwa n’umuriro, kandi uwo na wo uzokwerekana agaciro k’igikorwa c’umuntu wese. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ibikorwa vyiwe nivyarama, azohabwa impera. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ariko uwo muriro niwabitongora, uwo mwubatsi azohomba impera yavyo, ariko wewe arokoka ameze kurya k’uwokowe mu muriro.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Mbega ntimuzi ko muri urusengero rw’Imana kandi ko Mpwemu w’Imana aba muri mwebwe? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Nihagira uwusambura urusengero rw’Imana, na we Imana izomurandura, kuko urusengero rw’Imana ari urwera, kandi urwo rusengero ni mwebwe.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Ntimwihende! Nimba muri mwebwe hari uwibaza ko ari umunyabwenge afatiye ku rugero rw’ubwenge bwo mw’isi, yari akwiye kuba ikijuju kugira ngo ashobore kuba umunyabwenge w’ukuri, <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />kuko imbere y’Imana ubwenge bw’iyi si ari ubujuju, nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga biti: “Imana ifatira abigira abanyabwenge mu bugunge bwabo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Yobu 5:13</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Ahandi na ho handitswe ngo: “Umwami Imana arazi ivyiyumviro vy’uwigira umunyabwenge, kandi arazi ko ari ubusa gusa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Zaburi 94:11</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Nuko rero ntihakagire uwirata ko ari umwigishwa w’umuntu n’umwe, kuko vyose ari ivyanyu: <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />yaba Pawulo, yaba Apolo, yaba Kefa, yaba isi, yaba ubugingo canke urupfu, yaba ibiriho canke ibizoza, vyose ni ivyanyu, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />namwe muri aba Kristo, Kristo na we ni uw’Imana.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Umuhamagaro w’Intumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Nuko rero mwese mudufate nk’abakozi ba Kristo, abo Imana yajeje kumenyekanisha amabanga yayo yahishuye. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Iyo umukozi ajejwe ibintu, ico asabwa ni ukuba umwizigirwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Ku binyerekeye, nta co bintwaye gucirwa urubanza namwe canke n’ubundi bucamanza bwose bw’abantu. Ariko jewe ubwanje nta rubanza nicira. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Mu mutima wanje nta jwi rinyagiriza ikibi, ariko ivyo ntibisigura ko nera. Umwami Imana ni we ancira urubanza. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Ni co gituma mudakwiye guca urubanza igihe co guca imanza kitaragera; nimurindire gushika Umwami Yesu agarutse. Ni we azonyegurura ivyanyegejwe mu mwijima, yongere ashire ahabona ivyiyumviro vyo mu mitima y’abantu. Aho ni ho umuntu wese azohabwa n’Imana ishimwe rimukwiye.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Bene Data, natanze akarorero kuri jewe no kuri Apolo ku bwanyu, kugira ngo mutwigireko iri jambo rivuga riti: “Ntimukarenge ku vyanditswe;” aho ni ho ata n’umwe muri mwebwe azokwirata kuba umwigishwa w’umwe ngo amurutishe uwundi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Mbega ni nde yababwiye ko muruta abandi? Hari ico mufise mutahawe? None nimba ico mufise cose mwaragihawe, ni kuki mwishira hejuru nk’aho mutagihawe?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Mwibaza ko mukwije vyose! Mwibaza ko mumaze gutunga! Muramaze no kuba abami tutari kumwe! Icompa mukaba abami vy’ukuri kugira ngo tuganzanye namwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ku bwanje, twebwe intumwa tumeze nk’imbohe z’intambara zigenewe kwicwa. Imana yadushize ku murongo inyuma y’abadufashe mpiri, mu birori vyabo vyo kwigina intsinzi. Twahindutse akamenyo kw’isi yose, mu maso y’abamarayika no mu maso y’abantu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Turi ibijuju ku bwa Kristo, ariko mweho mwigira abanyabwenge muri Kristo. Turi abanyantegenke, ariko mweho mwigira abanyenkomezi. Muri abanyacubahiro, ariko twebwe turakengeretse. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Gushika n’ubu turasonza kandi tukanyoterwa, ntitugira ico twambara, turakubitwa, kandi ntitugira aho tuba. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Dukoresha amaboko yacu tukaruha kugira ngo turonke ibidutunga. Duhezagira abatuvuma, tukihanganira guhamwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Iyo batuvuze nabi, twishurana ubugwaneza. Gushika n’ubu dufatwa nk’umwavu wo kw’isi, ivyatawe na bose.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ahanura ab’i Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Sindabandikiye ibi kugira ngo ndabamaramaze, ahubwo nipfuza kubaburira nk’abana banje nkunda cane. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Kuko naho mufise abarezi ibihumbi cumi muri Kristo, ntimufise ba so benshi, kuko ni jewe nabavyaje Ubutumwa Bwiza muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ndabinginga rero ngo munyigane. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Ni co gituma nabarungikiye Timoteyo, umwana wanje nkunda kandi w’umwizigirwa mu Mwami. Azobibutsa ingene mbayeho muri Kristo Yesu, nk’uko ndavyigisha hose mu mashengero yose.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Bamwe muri mwebwe batewe n’ubwibone bibaza ko ntazoza kubagendera. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Ariko, Umwami Imana niyabikunda, nzobagendera vuba, kandi sinzokwumviriza gusa amajambo y’abo bantu b’ubwibone, ahubwo nzorondera kumenya nimba bakoreshwa n’ubushobozi bw’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kuko Ubwami bw’Imana atari amajambo gusa, ahubwo ni ubushobozi. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Mbega mugomba nzobagendere nzanye inkoni yo kubahana? Canke icoba ciza ni uko noza mfise umutima w’urukundo n’ubugwaneza?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ubusambanyi bwari mw’ishengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Narumvise ko hari ingeso y’ubusambanyi hagati muri mwebwe, ubusambanyi butaba no mu bantu batizera Imana: numvise ko hari umugabo yarongoye umugore wa se. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Kandi ikibabaje, aho gutuntuzwa n’ivyo, maze umuntu yabikoze mukamutaramura muri mwebwe, mubandanya mwishira hejuru. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />N’aho ntari kumwe namwe mu buryo bw’umubiri, ndi kumwe namwe mu buryo bw’impwemu. Uwo muntu yakoze ivyo naramaze kumucira urubanza nk’aho noba ndi kumwe namwe. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Nuko rero nimwakorana mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu, nanje nkabana namwe mu buryo bw’impwemu, ubushobozi bw’Umwami wacu buzoba buri hagati muri twebwe, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />maze uwo muntu muze mumuhe Satani kugira ngo akamere k’icaha kiwe karanduke, ariko impwemu yiwe izorokoke ku musi w’Umwami Imana.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Ntivyari bikwiye ko mwishira hejuru. Mbega ntimuzi ko icaha kimeze nk’umwambiro mukeya bashira mu gikandu maze kigatutumba cose? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Nimukure rero muri mwebwe umwambiro wa kera, kugira ngo mube igikandu kitagira umwambiro. Mu vy’ukuri ni co muri, kuko Kristo, umwagazi w’intama wa Pasika, yatanzwe nk’ikimazi ku bwacu. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Ni co gituma dukwiye guhimbaza uwo musi mukuru tudakoresheje imikate irimwo umwambiro wa kera, ari wo mwambiro w’ubugunge n’ubukozi bw’ikibi, ariko dukoresheje imikate itarimwo umwambiro, ari vyo kutagira uburyarya no kuba abanyakuri.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Igihe nabandikira ubwa mbere nari nababujije kwifatanya n’abantu b’ingeso z’ubusambanyi. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Simvuga abantu bo mu b’iyi si bagendera mu ngeso z’ubusambanyi, canke ingunge, canke abasuma, canke abasenga ibigirwamana, kuko vyosaba ko muva muri iyi si kugira mushobore kwirinda abantu nk’abo. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Ahubwo nababwira kutifatanya n’uwigira mwene Data ariko ari umusambanyi, ingunge, asenga ibigirwamana, avuga nabi abandi, aborerwa, canke yiba. Umuntu nk’uwo ntimukwiye no gusangira ivyokurya.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Si igikorwa canje gucira urubanza abatari mw’ishengero, ariko ni igikorwa canyu gucira urubanza ababandanya bakora ivyaha bari mw’ishengero. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Imana ni yo izocira urubanza abatizera, ariko nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga, “Nimwirukane inkozi y’ikibi iri hagati muri mwebwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 17:7">Gusubiramwo 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:21">22:21</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 22:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:7">24:7</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuburana hagati y’abizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Iyo umwe muri mwebwe agize ico apfa na mwene Data wundi, ni kuki amwitwarira mu batubaha Imana ngo babe ari bo babacira urubanza, aho kwitura abizera ngo babatature? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Mbega ntimuzi ko abizera ari bo bazocira imanza isi? None nimba muzocira imanza isi, mwonanirwa no gutatura amatati asanzwe? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Mbega ntimuzi ko muzocira imanza n’abamarayika? Ni co gituma mwari mukwiye gutatura amatati asanzwe yo muri buno buzima. <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />None iyo hadutse amatati yo muri ubu buzima, ni kuki muja kuronderera abacamanza mu bantu batanemewe mw’ishengero? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ibi ndabivuze kugira ngo ndabamaramaze. Birashoboka ko muri mwebwe habura n’umwe afise ubwenge, ashoboye gutatura amatati ari hagati mu bizera? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Ariko aho gutatura ayo matati mwebwe nyene, mwene Data umwe yitwarira mugenziwe, kandi akamwitwarira ku batizera!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />No kuba mufitaniye imanza hagati yanyu, ivyo vyonyene vyerekana ko mwamaze kunanirwa. Ni kuki mudashobora kwihanganira akarenganyo? Ni kuki mudashobora kwihanganira ababiba? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Ariko ntibitangaje na mwebwe ubwanyu murarenganya mukongera mukiba, kandi ivyo mukabikorera bene Data bandi. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Mbega ntimuzi ko inkozi z’ibibi zitazoragwa Ubwami bw’Imana? Ntimukibeshe: abihumanisha ibijanye n’ibitsina, abasenga ibigirwamana, abasambanyi, abagabo bihindura abagore mu bumaraya, abahuza ibitsina n’abafise ibisa n’ivyabo, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />abasuma, ingunge, imborerwa, abavuga nabi abandi, n’abambuzi ntibazoragwa Ubwami bw’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Kandi bamwe muri mwebwe bari bameze nk’abo. Ariko mwarogejwe, murezwa, mwongera mwemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi mw’izina ry’Umwami Yesu Kristo, mubihawe na Mpwemu w’Imana yacu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imibiri yacu ni Ingoro za Mpwemu Yera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Hari uwuvuga ati: “Vyose ndavyemerewe.” Ni vyo, ariko si vyose bingirira akamaro. Naho vyose ndavyemerewe, sinemera kuganzwa n’ikintu na kimwe. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Uwundi avuga ati: “Ivyokurya ni ivy’inda, n’inda ni iy’ivyokurya kandi Imana izobirandura vyompi.” Yamara umubiri ntiwaremewe kuganzwa n’ubusambanyi, ariko waremewe kuba uw’Umwami Imana, kandi ni we awitaho. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Imana, mu bushobozi bwayo, yazuye Umwami Yesu mu bapfuye, kandi natwe izotuzura. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Mbega ntimuzi ko imibiri yanyu ari ibihimba vy’umubiri wa Kristo? None nubahuke mfate ibihimba vy’umubiri wa Kristo, ndabifatanye n’umumaraya? Ntibikabe! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Mbega ntimuzi ko uwifatanije n’umumaraya aba abaye umubiri umwe na we? Kuko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo: “Uko ari babiri bazoba babaye umubiri umwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Itanguriro 2:24</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Ariko uwifatanije n’Umwami Imana aba abaye umwe na we mu buryo bw’impwemu.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Mwirinde ubusambanyi. Nta kindi caha gifise ingaruka ku mubiri kunganya ico. Uwusambana aba acumuye no ku mubiri wiwe na wo. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Mbega ntimuzi ko imibiri yanyu ari insengero za Mpwemu Yera aba muri mwebwe, uwo mwahawe n’Imana? Erega ntimuciganza <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />kuko mwaguzwe igiciro kinini. Nuko rero mwubahishe Imana imibiri yanyu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye n’amabanga y’abubatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Ku bijanye n’ivyo mwambajije mw’ikete mwanyandikiye, ni vyiza ko umuntu atorongora. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Ariko kubera ubusambanyi ari bwinshi, umugabo wese akwiye kugira umugore wiwe, kandi n’umugore wese akwiye kugira umugabo wiwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Umugabo ategerezwa kurangura amabanga y’abubatse n’umugore wiwe, n’umugore wiwe ni uko nyene. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Umugore aba yemeye guha umubiri wiwe umugabo ngo abe ari we awuganza, kandi n’umugabo n’uko aba yemeye guha umubiri wiwe umugore ngo abe ari we awuganza. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Ntihakagire uwanka kurangura amabanga y’abubatse n’uwundi, kiretse mwumvikanye kwihangana igihe gito, kugira ngo mufate umwanya wo gusenga. Hanyuma mugaca musubira kubana bisanzwe kugira ngo Satani ntaronke aho abaca ngo abageragereshe ukunanirwa kuganza imibiri yanyu. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ibi ndabibabwiye nk’impanuro si itegeko ndabahaye. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ico nipfuza ni uko abantu bose boba nkanje. Ariko umuntu wese afise ingabire yisangije yahawe n’Imana; umwe agira ingabire kanaka, uwundi akagira iyindi.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Abatubatse n’abapfakaye bakwiye kuguma uko bari, nk’uko nanje ndi. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Ariko nimba badashobora kuganza imibiri yabo, bakwiye kwubaka, kuko umuntu yopfuma agira uwo bubakanye hako arengerwa n’ivyipfuzo vy’umubiri.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Ku bubatse, ntanze iri tegeko, ritavuye kuri jewe ariko rivuye ku Mwami Imana: umugore ntakahukane n’umugabo wiwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Ariko bishitse akahukana, ntaze asubire kurongorwa, canke na ho aze asubirane n’umugabo wiwe. N’umugabo na we ntakirukane umugore wiwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Abandi na bo, ibi ni vyo ndababwira, ariko ni jewe ubwanje, si Umwami Imana: mwene Data niyaba afise umugore atizera hanyuma uwo mugore agashaka kugumana na we, ntaze amwirukane. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Kandi mwene Data niyaba afise umugabo atizera, maze uwo mugabo akaba ashaka kugumana na we, ntaze avane na we. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kuko umubano n’umugabo atizera wezwa biciye ku mugore wiwe yizera, kandi n’umubano hamwe n’umugore atizera wezwa biciye ku mugabo wiwe yizera. Ahandi ho abana banyu bobaye abahumanye, ariko noneho barejejwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ariko umugabo atizera canke umugore atizera agomvye kuvana n’uwo bubakanye yizera, amureke yigire. Muri ico gihe uwo mugabo canke uwo umugore yizera ntaba akibohewe kuri uwo bubakanye atizera, kuko Imana yaduhamagariye kuba mu mahoro. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Mbega wa mugore we, ni igiki kikwemeza ko umugabo wawe azokizwa kubera wewe? Canke wa mugabo we, ni igiki kikwemeza ko umugore wawe azokizwa kubera wewe?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuzima bw’inyuma yo guhamagarwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ariko rero umuntu wese akwiye kubaho ubuzima rukristo mu bihe vyose n’ahantu hose Umwami yamugeneye, kandi yisunze uko Imana yamuhamagaye. Iri ni ryo tegeko ntanga mu mashengero yose. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Nk’akarorero, nimba umugabo yari yarakebwe imbere yuko ahamagarwa, ntarondere kubihindura. Niyaba na ho atari yarakebwe igihe yahamagarwa, ntarondere gukebwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ugukebwa canke ukudakebwa vyompi nta co bimaze. Igihambaye ni ugukurikiza amabwirizwa y’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Umuntu wese akwiye kuguma uko yari ameze igihe Imana yamuhamagara.<verse eid="1CO 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Nimba wari umugurano igihe Imana yaguhamara, ntibiguhagarike umutima. Ariko niwaronka ibakwe ryo kwidegemvya, widegemvye. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kuko uwahamagawe n’Umwami ari umugurano aba abaye uwidegemvya mu Mwami, kandi uwahamagawe n’Umwami yidegemvya aba abaye umugurano wa Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mwaguzwe igiciro kinini; nuko rero ntimukabe abaja b’abantu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Bene Data, umuntu wese agume nk’uko yari ameze igihe Imana yamuhamagara.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’abashaje batubatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Ku vyerekeye abatararongorwa, nta bwirizwa nahawe n’Umwami, ariko ndababwira ico niyumvira nk’umuntu w’umwizigirwa yagiriwe ubuntu n’Umwami. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Kubera ibihe bigoye turimwo, niyumvira ko umuntu yoguma uko asanzwe ari ubu. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Nimba wararongoye, nturondere kwahukana. Nimba utarongora, nturondere kurongora. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Urongoye nta caha uba ukoze, kandi inkumi irongowe, nta caha iba ikoze. Ariko abarongora bazobona amakuba menshi muri buno buzima, nkaba numva nshaka kuyabarinda.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Bene Data, ico ngomba kuvuga ni uko igihe gisigaye ari gito. Uhereye ubu, abafise abagore ntibiteho cane ivy’ingo gusa, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />abarira babeho nk’abatarira, abari mu munezero babeho nk’abatanezerewe, abagura ibintu bamere nk’abatabifise. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Abari mu rudandazwa ntibatwarwe na rwo, kuko iyi si turimwo ubu igiye gukurwaho vuba.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nipfuza ko mubaho mwidegemvya, ata mwitwarariko w’ivy’ubu buzima. Umugabo atarongoye yitwararika ibikorwa vy’Umwami, akama arondera ingene amunezereza. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ariko uwarongoye yitwararika ivy’ino si, akarondera ingene yonezereza umugore wiwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Mu mutima wiwe aba akwegwa irya n’ino. Umugore canke inkumi itarongowe yitwararika ibikorwa vy’Umwami. Yihebera Umwami mu mubiri no mu mpwemu. Ariko uwarongowe yitwararika ivy’ino si, arondera ingene yonezereza umugabo wiwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ibi ndiko ndabivuga ku neza yanyu, sindiko ndabaremereza amategeko. Nshaka ko mukora ikiborohereza gukorera neza Umwami ata bibasamaza.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />None rero, umusore niyaba yipfuza cane umukobwa bazokwubakana, agatinya ko azohava amukorera ibidakwiye kuko vyanse ko yihangana, namurongore nk’uko avyipfuza, nta caha azoba akoze. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ariko nimba umusore yafashe ingingo mu mutima wiwe yo kutarongora, avyihitiyemwo kandi akaba ashoboye kwigumya, na we nyene aba agize neza. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Nuko rero uwurongoye inkumi yahisemwo aba agize neza, ariko uwutarongoye aba agize neza gusumba.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Umugore aba abohewe ku mugabo iyo akiriho. Ariko umugabo amaze gupfa, umugore aba afise uburenganzira bwo kurongorwa n’uwo ashaka wundi, mu gihe uwo mugabo aba yubaha Umwami Imana. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Ariko jewe niyumvira ko yonezerwa gusumba agumye uko yari ari, kandi nanje ndabahaye iyi mpanuro ndongowe na Mpwemu w’Imana.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye n’ivyashikaniwe ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Ku bijanye n’ivyashikaniwe ibigirwamana, ndazi ko twese dufise ico tubiziko. Ariko ubumenyi butuma umuntu yishira hejuru; urukundo ni rwo rwubaka. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Iyo umuntu yibwira ko azi ikintu, ntaba arakimenya gushika ku rugero yategerezwa gushitsako mu kukimenya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ariko uwukunda Imana we na yo iramuzi.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />None rero ku bijanye n’ivyashikaniwe ibigirwamana, turazi ko ikigirwamana ari ubusa ngaha kw’isi, kandi ko hari Imana imwe gusa. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Hari ivyitwa “imana” vyinshi kw’isi no kw’ijuru, kandi hari abantu basenga imana nyinshi n’abami benshi. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Ariko tuzi ko hari Imana imwe, ari yo Data, yaremye vyose kandi tubayeho ku bwayo. Hari Umwami umwe, ari we Yesu Kristo. Vyose vyaremewe muri we, kandi muri we ni ho twaherewe ubugingo.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Ariko abizera bose ntibafise ubwo bumenyi. Bamwe baramenyereye gusenga ibigirwamana gushika aho n’ubu, iyo bariye ivyashikaniwe ivyo bigirwamana, kandi bakabirya bafise ico ciyumviro, baca bagirizwa mu mitima yabo itarakomera, bakumva ko bihumanije. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ariko, imfungurwa si zo zitwegereza Imana; tubiriye ntiduca tuba babi imbere y’Imana kandi tutabiriye ntiduca tuba beza.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ariko mube maso kugira ngo umwidegemvyo wanyu ntutume abanyantegenke bakora icaha. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Mbega umuntu w’umunyantegenke niyakubona wewe umusumvya ugutahura uriko urira mu ngoro y’ibigirwamana, ntibizotuma kubera intege nke ziwe, aca arya ivyashikaniwe ibigirwamana? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Nuko rero, uwo mwene Data w’umunyantegenke Kristo yapfiriye, ntimumuranduze ugutahura kwanyu. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Mucumuye kuri bene Data muri ubwo buryo, muba mucumuye kuri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ni co gituma, nimba ivyokurya vyotuma mwene Data akora icaha, sinzokwigera ndya inyama kugira ngo sintume atsitara akagwa.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ivy’uburenganzira bw’intumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Mbega sindi uwidegemvya? Mbega sindi intumwa? Mbega siniboneye Yesu Umwami wacu amaso mu yandi? Mbega ntimuri ivyamwa vy’ibikorwa nakoreye Umwami? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />N’aho ntoba intumwa ku bandi, kuri mwebwe ndi yo. Namwe ubwanyu muri icemeza uko ndi intumwa y’Umwami.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Iki ni co nireguza ku bancira imanza. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Mbega ntitwemerewe guhabwa ivyokurya n’ivyo kunywa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Mbega ntitwemerewe kubana n’abagore bizera nk’uko izindi ntumwa, abavukanyi b’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo na Kefa babigira? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Canke ni jewe na Baranaba dutegerezwa gukora twenyene kugira ngo twitunge?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Ni nde yoba umusoda hanyuma agategerezwa kwibeshaho? Ni nde yotera uruzabibu hanyuma ntarye ivyamwa vyarwo? Ni nde yoragira amasho hanyuma ntanywe amata yayo? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Mbega ibi ndabibabwiye bivuye mu vyiyumviro vy’abantu? Canke n’ivyagezwe vya Mose birafise ico bibivugako? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Muri ivyo vyagezwe haranditse ngo: “Ntimuze muzibire umunwa w’inka iriko irasekura ingano.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Gusubiramwo 25:4</ref></char></char></note> Mbega mwibaza ko ngaha Imana yariko ivuga inka isanzwe gusa? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Nta nkeka ibi ni twebwe yari ibivuzeko. Ibi vyandikiwe twebwe kugira ngo uwurima n’uwimbura bizigire kuzoronka umugabane wabo ku mwimbu. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ko twababivyemwo imbuto mu buryo bw’impwemu, ntitwari dukwiye kubimburamwo ivyokurya vy’umubiri? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Nimba abandi babigisha bafise uburenganzira bwo kuronka ibibabeshaho muri mwebwe, mbega twebwe ntitwari dukwiye kuronka ibirenze?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ariko ntitwigeze duharanira ubwo burenganzira. Ahubwo turimenya muri vyose kugira ntitube intambamyi ku Butumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Mbega ntimuzi ko abakora mu rusengero barya ivyo mu rusengero, kandi ko n’abakora ku gicaniro barya ivyashikanywe ku gicaniro? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Ni muri ubwo buryo nyene, Umwami yategetse ko abavuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bazotungwa n’ubwo Butumwa nyene.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ariko sinigeze ngwanira na kimwe muri ibi nari nemerewe, kandi sindabandikiye iri kete kugira ngo mutangure kumpa ibimbeshaho. Nopfuma mpfa hako ntakaza ibi vyirato vyo kuvuga ubutumwa ata we ndemereye. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ariko iyo mvuze ubutumwa, sinshobora kuvyirata kuko mba nshikije itegeko ry’Imana. Noba ngowe ntavuze Ubutumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Mvuze ubutumwa bivuye ku mutima ubikunze, ndonka impera. Ariko ndabuvuze umutima utabikunze, kuba ari ukwikurayo. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Mbega impera yanje ni iyihe? Ni uko mvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza ata we ndemereye, ntahagaze ku burenganzira nari mfise nk’umuvugabutumwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwete wa Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />N’aho ndi uwidegemvya nkaba ntajakariye umuntu n’umwe, nigira umugurano ku bantu bose kugira ngo nshobore kuzana benshi kuri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ku Bayuda nabaye nk’uwuganzwa n’ivyagezwe n’aho ntaganzwa na vyo, kugira ngo nzane kuri Kristo abaganzwa n’ivyagezwe. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Ku banyamahanga batagira ivyagezwe nabayeho nk’uwutabigira n’aho nganzwa n’ivyagezwe vy’Imana, nkubaha ivyagezwe vya Kristo, kugira ngo nzane abatagira ivyagezwe kuri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Ku banyantegenke nigize umunyantegenke kugira ngo nzane abanyantegenke kuri Kristo. Nabaye vyose kuri bose kugira nkore ibishoboka vyose hagire na bamwe muri bo bakizwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Ibi vyose ndabikora kugira Ubutumwa Bwiza bukwire hose, maze nanje nze mpabwe imigisha ijana na bwo.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Guhiganirwa impera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ntimuzi ko mw’ihiganwa hiruka benshi, ariko uwuhabwa umudari akaba umwe? Nuko rero muhiganwe nk’abazohabwa umudari. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Abaja mw’ihiganwa bose bagira imyiteguro ikomeye. Bayigira kugira bazoronke impera ihera, ariko twebwe tugira imyiteguro kugira tuzoronke impera ihoraho. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Nuko rero siniruka nk’uwutagira intumbero, canke uwugwana akubita ingumu ahusha uwo bagwana. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Ntoza indero umubiri wanje, nkawugira umuja wanje, kugira ngo maze kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza sinsange narushijwe mw’ihiganwa, nkabura impera.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Twigire ku vyabaye ku Bisirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Bene Data, singomba ko mwibagira ko ba sogokuruza mu bugaragwa bagendera musi y’igicu, kandi ko bose bajabutse baciye mu kiyaga. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Muri ico gicu no muri ico kiyaga, bose babatiririjwe kuba abigishwa ba Mose. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Bose bariye ivyokurya bimwe vy’impwemu, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />banywa no ku kinyobwa kimwe c’impwemu; kuko banyoye ku gitandara c’impwemu cabaherekeza, ico gitandara na co cari Yesu Kristo ubwiwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ariko benshi muri bo ntibanezereye Imana, kuko imivyimba yabo yandagaye mu bugaragwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Ivyo vyose vyabaye ngo bitubere akarorero kugira ngo imitima yacu ntiyipfuze gukora ivyaha nk’uko babigize. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Ntimugasenge ibigirwamana nk’uko bamwe muri bo babisenze, nk’uko handitswe ngo: “Baricaye bararya, baranywa, hanyuma barahaguruka barinezereza.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Kuvayo 32:6</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Ntituje mu busambanyi nk’uko bamwe muri bo babigize, maze ku musi umwe gusa hagapfa abantu ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitatu. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Ntitugerageze Kristo nk’uko bamwe babigize bakamarwa n’inzoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Kandi ntimukidodombe nk’uko bamwe babigize, maze bakicwa n’umumarayika muranduzi.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Ivyo vyashitse kugira ngo bitubere akarorero ko kutuburira, twebwe abo mu gihe ca nyuma. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Nuko rero uwibaza ko ahagaze, yiyubare ntagwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Nta kibagerageza cabashikiye kidashikira abandi. Kandi Imana ni iyo kwizigirwa, ntizobareka ngo mugeragezwe n’ivyo mudashobora kwihanganira. Mu gihe co kugeragezwa, izobacira inzira kugira ngo mushobore kuvyihanganira.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntitugasenge ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />None rero abo nkunda, mwirinde gusenga ibigirwamana. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Ndababwira nk’abafise ugutahura. Nimurabe mwebwe nyene ko ivyo ndababwira atari ukuri. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Iyo tunywera ku gikombe Imana yahezagiye, mbega ntituba dusangiye ku maraso ya Kristo? Iyo tumanyura umukate, ntituba dusangiye ku mubiri wa Kristo? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Iyo dusangiye ku mukate umwe tuba tubaye umubiri umwe n’aho turi benshi.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Nimurabe Abisirayeli: mbega abarya ivyatanzwe nk’ishikanwa ntibaba bifatanirije hamwe ku gicaniro? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Mbega ngomvye kuvuga ko ivyashikaniwe ibigirwamana canke ibigirwamana ubwavyo ata co bimaze? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Haba na mba. Ivyashikaniwe ibigirwamana biba vyashikaniwe abadayimoni, ari na co gituma ntashaka ko musangira n’abadayimoni. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ntimushobora kunywera ku gikombe c’Umwami hanyuma ngo mwongere munywere ku gikombe c’abadayimoni. Ntimushobora kurira ku meza y’Umwami hanyuma ngo mwongere murire ku meza y’abadayimoni. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Mbega mugomba tuvyure ishari ry’Umwami? Mwibaza ko tumusumvya inguvu?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwidegemvyo w’abizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Muvuga muti: “Vyose turavyemerewe,” yamara si vyose bigira ikimazi. Muvuga muti: “Vyose turavyemerewe,” yamara si vyose vyubaka. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Ntihakagire uwurondera ineza yiwe gusa, ariko twiteho no kugirira abandi neza.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Muze murye inyama izo ari zo zose zashowe mu kaguriro, ata co murinze kuzibazako, <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />kuko “isi ari iy’Umwami Imana, n’ibiri muri yo vyose.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Zaburi 24:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Uwutizera niyagutumira iwe gufungura ukagenda, uzofungure ivyo akuzimanye vyose ata co urinze kuvyibazako. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ariko niyakubwira ati: “Ibi vyashikaniwe ibigirwamana,” ntuzobirye ku bw’ineza y’uwo munyantegenke yabikubwiye, kugira ngo ntagire ijwi rimwagiriza mu mutima. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Nta co bitwaye kuri mwebwe, ariko hari ico vyica kuri uwo yabibabwiye. Umwidegemvyo wanje ntukwiye kuba igitsitaza ku bandi. <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Iyo ndabiriyeko nshimira Imana, kubera iki abantu bancira imanza kuri ivyo vyokurya nashimiye Imana?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Nuko rero iyo murya canke munywa, canke mukora ikindi kintu cose, mubikore muhesha Imana icubahiro. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Ntihakagire uwo mutsitaza, yaba Umuyuda canke Umugiriki, canke abo mw’ishengero ry’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Na jewe ngerageza kunezereza bose mu vyo nkora vyose. Simpfa gukora ibimpimbara, ariko nkora ibihimbara abandi kugira benshi bashike ku gakiza.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Munyigane nk’uko nanje nigana Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye no kwitwikira mu gusenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Ndabashimira cane ko munyibuka mu vyo mukora vyose, kandi mukaba mwaragumije inyigisho zanje nk’uko nazibahaye. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ariko hari ico mukwiye kumenya: umutwe w’umugabo ni Kristo, umutwe w’umugore ni umugabo wiwe, umutwe wa Kristo na wo ni Imana, <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Umugabo asenga canke avugishwa n’Imana atwikiriye umutwe aba asuzuguje umutwe wiwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Ariko umugore asenga canke akavugishwa n’Imana adatwikiriye umutwe wiwe aba asuzuguje umutwe wiwe, co kimwe n’iyo yiharanguje. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Umugore adatwikiriye umutwe wiwe ariko arasenga, akwiye kumobwa. Kandi nimba ari igiterasoni ku mugore kumwa umushatsi canke kwiharanguza, nawutwikire.<verse eid="1CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Umugabo ntakwiye gutwikira umutwe wiwe, kuko umugabo ni ishusho y’ubwiza bw’Imana; ariko umugore ni ishusho y’ubwiza bw’umugabo. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Kuko umugabo ntiyavuye mu mugore, ariko umugore yavuye mu mugabo; <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />kandi umugabo ntiyaremwe ku bw’umugore, ariko umugore yaremwe ku bw’umugabo. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ni co gutuma rero, kubera abamarayika batwihweza, umugore akwiye gutwikira umutwe wiwe, kugira yerekane ko ari musi y’ubundi bubasha. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ariko mu Mwami, umugore yuzuza umugabo, kandi umugabo yuzuza umugore. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Kuko nk’uko umugore yavuye mu mugabo, umugabo na we avyarwa n’umugore. Ariko ibintu vyose biva ku Mana.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Nabe ari mwebwe nyene mwicira urubanza: Mbega birabereye ko umugore asenga Imana adatwikiriye umutwe wiwe? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Mbega mu vyo kamere y’ibintu itwigisha, si ibiterasoni ko umugabo atereka umushatsi, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />ariko umugore awuteretse umubera ubwiza bwiwe? Kuko yawuhawe ngo umubere nk’igitambara kimutwikira. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ariko nimba hariho uwufise ibihari kuri ibi, nobabwira ko ata wundi mugenzo dufise atari uwo, kandi n’ayandi mashengero y’Imana ni uko abikora.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uko dukwiye kwegera ingaburo y’Umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Mu vyo ngira ndababwire, sindabashima na gato, kuko amakoraniro yanyu yuzuyemwo ibibi gusumba ivyiza. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ica mbere, narumvise ko iyo mukoraniye mu rusengero mwicamwo ibice, kandi ndakeka ko ari vyo. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Sinkekeranya ko hoba hariho ukwitandukanya muri mwebwe, kugira ngo abemewe n’Imana bagaragare. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Iyo mukoranye, ntimurya ku ngaburo y’Umwami, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />kuko iyo mufungura, bamwe muri mwebwe bihutira gufungura ivyabo ntibasangire n’abandi. Ivyo bituma haba abataha bashonje, abandi bagataha baborewe. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Mbega ntimufise iwanyu aho mwofungurira mukongera mukanywera? Canke mushaka kwonona urusengero rw’Imana no kumaramaza abakene? Ndababwire iki? Mbe mushaka ko ndabashima? Ntibishoboka!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Kuko ico nahawe n’Umwami ari co nanje nabashikirije: muri rya joro Umwami Yesu yagurishwa, yakiriye umukate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />awushimira Imana, arawumanyura, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Uwu ni umubiri wanje utanzwe ku bwanyu. Muzohore mukora gutya munyibuka.”</char> <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Bahejeje gufungura, agira uko nyene, afata igikombe, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Iki gikombe ni isezerano rishasha ritangujwe n’amaraso yanje. Muzohore mukora gutya, igihe cose mukinywereyeko, mubikore munyibuka.”</char> <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kuko igihe cose muzorya uwu mukate mukanywera no kuri iki gikombe, muzoba muriko muramenyekanisha urupfu rwanje gushika aho nzogarukira.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Ni co gituma uwurya umukate akanywa no ku gikombe uko bitabereye aba acumuye ku mubiri n’amaraso vy’Umwami. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Umuntu wese akwiye kwisuzuma imbere yo kurya uwo mukate no kunywera kuri ico gikombe. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Kuko uwurya uwo mukate akanywera no kuri ico gikombe adahaye icubahiro umubiri wa Kristo aba yikwegeye gutsindwa n’urubanza. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ni co gituma bamwe muri mwebwe bagira intege nke, bakagwara, ndetse abandi bakaba baranapfuye. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Iyo twirimbuye twebwe nyene tukicira urubanza, Imana ntiba ikiruduciriye. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ariko Umwami aduciriye urubanza, aba adutoje indero kugira ngo ntituzocirwe urubanza hamwe n’abo mw’isi.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />None rero bene Data, iyo mukoraniye ku ngaburo y’Umwami, mube murindirana. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Uwuzokwumva ashonje cane azofungure iwe kugira ngo yoye kwikwegera gutsindwa n’urubanza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Ku bindi bibazo mwanyandikiye, nzobaha inyishu ninashika iwanyu.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye n’ingabire za Mpwemu Yera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Bene Data, ibijanye n’ingabire za Mpwemu Yera, nshaka ko mubitahura neza. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Murazi ko mukiri abanyamahanga mwazimizwa n’ibigirwamana bitavuga. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Ni co gituma ndababwira ko ata wuvugishwa na Mpwemu w’Imana yovuga ati: “Yesu ni ikivume,” kandi nta wovuga ati: “Yesu ni Umwami,” kiretse abivugishijwe na Mpwemu Yera.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Hari ingabire zitandukanye ariko Mpwemu azitanga ni umwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Imirimo ni myinshi ariko Umwami dukorera ni umwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Ibikorwa vy’Imana ni vyinshi, ariko iyo Mana nyene ni yo ibikorera muri twebwe twese.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Mpwemu w’Imana yiyerekanira mu ngabire kuri umwumwe wese ku neza ya bose. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Bamwe bahawe na Mpwemu gutanga impanuro zirimwo ubwenge, abandi uwo Mpwemu nyene abaha ubumenyi budasanzwe, <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />abandi abaha ingabire y’ukwizera, abandi abaha gukiza ingwara, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />abandi abaha ububasha bwo gukora ibitangaza, abandi abaha kuvugishwa n’Imana, abandi abaha kurobanura impwemu, abandi abaha kuvuga indimi zitamenyekana, abandi na bo abaha gusobanura izo ndimi. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Izo ngabire zose zitangwa na Mpwemu umwe, akaziha uwo agomba nk’uko abishatse.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Turi ingingo nyinshi zigize umubiri umwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Umubiri ni umwe n’aho ugizwe n’ibihimba vyinshi; kandi n’aho ibihimba vyawo ari vyinshi bigize umubiri umwe. N’umubiri wa Kristo ni uko. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Twese twabatijwe na Mpwemu umwe mu mubiri umwe: Abayuda, Abagiriki, abagurano, n’abidegemvya, kandi twese twahawe Mpwemu umwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Umubiri ntugizwe n’igihimba kimwe, ugizwe n’ibihimba vyinshi.<verse eid="1CO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ikirenge kivuze giti: “Ko ntari ukuboko, sindi igihimba c’umubiri,” ivyo ntivyotuma kireka kuba igihimba c’umubiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Kandi ugutwi kuvuze guti: “Ko ntari ijisho, sindi igihimba c’umubiri,” ivyo ntivyotuma kireka kuba igihimba c’umubiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Mbega nka hamwe umubiri wose woba ijisho gusa, kwumva vyoca bibera he? Canke na ho nka hamwe umubiri wose woba ugutwi, kumoterwa vyoca bibera he? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Ariko noneho Imana yashize ibihimba bitandukanye ku mubiri, kimwekimwe cose aho biyihimbaye kugishira. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Umubiri ntiwoba umubiri mu gihe woba ugizwe n’igihimba kimwe gusa. <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Nk’uko bimeze rero, hari ibihimba vyinshi ariko umubiri ni umwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Ijisho ntiryobarira ukoboko riti: “Sindagukeneye,” kandi umutwe ntiwobwira ibirenge uti: “Sindabakeneye.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ahubwo n’ibihimba vyose womenga ni bitobito kurusha ibindi birakenewe cane. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Kandi ibihimba womenga ntivyubashwe cane ni vyo twitwararika cane kwambika. Ibihimba tutipfuza ko bija ahabona ni vyo twitwararika gufata neza, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />ariko ibija ahabona tubifata ibisanzwe. Imana yafatanije ibihimba vy’umubiri vyose ica iha icubahiro ibitagifise, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />kugira ngo ntihabe ukwitandukanya kw’umubiri, ahubwo ibihimba vyose vyitaneho ku rugero rungana. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Iyo hagize igihimba kimwe kigwara, ibindi vyose bigwarana na co. Kandi iyo igihimba kimwe cubashwe, ibindi vyose binezeranwa na co.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Namwe muri umubiri wa Kristo, kandi umwe wese muri mwebwe ni igihimba c’uwo mubiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Ibi ni vyo bihimba vy’umubiri Imana yashize mw’ishengero: hari intumwa, abavugishwa n’Imana, abigisha, abakora ibitangaza, abafise ingabire zo gukiza ingwara, abafise ingabire zo gufasha abandi, abafise ingabire z’uburongozi, n’abavuga indimi zitandukanye. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Mbega bose ni intumwa? Mbega bose ni abavugishwa n’Imana? Mbega bose ni abigisha? Bose bakora ibitangaza? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Bose bafise ingabire zo gukiza ingwara? Bose bavuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana? Bose basobanura indimi? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ariko mwipfuze ingabire zisumba izindi zose.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1CO 12:31">Urukundo ruruta vyose</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Reka ndabereke inzira irashe gusumba izindi zose.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Naho novuga indimi z’abantu n’iz’abamarayika ntagira urukundo, noba meze nk’inkengeri canke icuma gisamirana. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Naho nogira ingabire yo kuvugishwa n’Imana, nkagira ukwizera kwokwimura imisozi ariko ntagira urukundo, vyoba ari ubusa. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Naho nofata ivyanje vyose nkabiha abakene, ndetse naho notanga umubiri wanje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe barongerako ngo “ngo uturirwe”.</char></note> kugira ngo ngire ico nirata ariko ntagira urukundo, vyoba ari ubusa.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Urukundo rurihangana, rugira neza, ntirugira ishari, ntirwihayagiza, kandi ntirwishira hejuru. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Ntiruteza isoni abandi, ntirurondera inyungu zarwo, ntirutwarwa n’ishavu, kandi ntirubika ikibi. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Urukundo ntirunezerererwa ikibi, ariko runezererwa ukuri. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Urukundo ntirucika intege, ntirutakaza ukwizera, ntirutakaza ivyizigiro, rukomeza kwihanganira ibihe uko bije kwose.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Urukundo ntiruzigera rurangira. Kuvugishwa n’Imana, kuvuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana, n’ubwenge budasanzwe bizohera. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Ubwenge dufise ubu ni agace gatoya, kandi n’ukuvugishwa n’Imana kwacu ni agace gatoya. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Ariko igihe kizogera aho vyose bizokwuzuzwa, maze ivy’ibice bikurweho. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Nkiri umwana navuga nk’umwana nkiyumvira nk’umwana. Ariko maze gukura niyambuye ivy’ubwana vyose. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Ivyo tubona ubu ni nk’ishusho yo mu cirore, ariko hazogera igihe tuzobona vyose neza amaso mu yandi. Ubu tuzi agace, ariko hari igihe tuzomenya vyose, nk’uko Imana ituzi neza.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />None rero hari ibintu bitatu bizokwamaho: ukwizera, ivyizigiro n’urukundo. Ariko igikuru muri vyose ni urukundo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye no kuvuga indimi zitamenyekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Murondere kugira urukundo kandi mwipfuze cane kuronka ingabire za Mpwemu, na canecane ingabire y’ukuvugishwa n’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Uwuvuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana ntaba ariko arabwira abantu, ahubwo aba ariko arabwira Imana, kandi nta n’uwushobora kumutahura. Impwemu yiwe iba iriko iravuga amabanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Ariko uwuvugishwa n’Imana aba ariko arabwira abantu kugira ngo bakomezwe, baterwe intege bongere birurwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Uwuvuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana aba ariko ariyubaka we nyene, ariko uwuvugishwa n’Imana aba ariko arubaka ishengero. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Nipfuza ko mwese muvuga mu ndimi, ariko ikirengeye ni uko mwovugishwa n’Imana. Uwuvugishwa n’Imana arahambaye gusumba uwuvuga mu ndimi, kiretse mu gihe yoba ashobora kuzisobanura kugira ishengero ryose rikomezwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Bene Data, mbega iyo nza iwanyu mvuga mu ndimi, nari kubamarira iki ntabazaniye ivyo nahishuriwe, amajambo y’ubwenge, ubuvugishwa canke inyigisho? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Ni ko bimeze no ku bicurarangisho bisanzwe bitagira ubuzima, nk’umwironge canke inanga. Mbega bivuze co kimwe, hari uwoshobora kumenya ikivugijwe? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Kandi n’inzamba itavugijwe mw’ijwi ribereye, abasoda bomenya ko bahamagawe ngo baje ku rugamba? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />No kuri mwebwe ni uko. Mutavuze amajambo atahurika mu rurimi rwanyu, nta womenya ico muriko muravuga. Mwoba muriko mubwira ikirere gusa. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Kw’isi hari indimi nyinshi, kandi nta na rumwe rutagira ico rusigura. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />None rero, ntaronse insiguro y’ivyo mbariwe noba ndi umunyamahanga kuri uwo ambarira, kandi na we nyene yoba ari umunyamahanga kuri jewe. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Na mwebwe ni uko. Ko mufise umwete wo kurondera ingabire za Mpwemu, mukore ibishoboka kugira muronke ingabire zubaka ishengero.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Ni co gituma nimba hari uwuvuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana yari akwiye gusenga Imana ngo imushoboze gusobanura ivyo avuga. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Kuko iyo nsenga mu ndimi zitamenyekana, impwemu yanje ni yo iba iriko irasenga, ariko simba ndiko nkoresha ubwenge bwanje. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />None ndabigenze gute? Nzosengesha impwemu yanje, ariko nzosengesha n’ubwenge. Nzoririmbisha impwemu yanje, ariko kandi nzoririmbisha n’ubwenge bwanje. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Nimwaba muriko muratazira Imana n’impwemu zanyu zonyene, abatabitahura bokwifatanya namwe gute, bakavuga “Amen” ku bw’amashimwe yanyu, kandi batumva ivyo muvuga? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Mushobora kuba muriko murashima Imana cane, ariko ntibizofasha abariko barabumva.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Ndashima Imana ko mvuga mu ndimi kubasumvya. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Ariko mu rusengero, mpitamwo kuvuga amajambo yumvikana atanu arimwo inyigisho aho kuvuga amajambo ibihumbi cumi mu ndimi zitamenyekana.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Bene Data, ntimube nk’abana bato mu gutahura ibi. Mube abana bato ku bijanye n’icaha, ariko mube nk’abakuze mu gutahura ibintu nk’ibi. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Mu vyagezwe haranditswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Nzobwira abantu banje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">mu ndimi zitazwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">nkoresheje akanwa ka ba kavantara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Ariko na ho nyene, ntibazonyumvira.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:11">Yesaya 28:11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 28:12">12</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Ni ko Umwami Imana avuze.<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Indimi zitamenyekana rero ni ikimenyetso ku batizera, si ku bizera. Ariko ubuvugishwa ntibuhari ku neza y’abizera, ni ku y’abatizera. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />None rero, abatizera canke abantu badatahura ivyo kuvuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana baje mu makoraniro y’ishengero yanyu, bakumva muvuga mu ndimi zitamenekana, bazokwibaza ko mwasaze. <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ariko abatizera canke abadatahura ivyo kuvuga indimi zitamenyekana nibaza bagasanga mwese muriko muravugishwa, bazokwemezwa mu mitima yabo ko ari abanyavyaha, kandi ko bazocirwa urubanza n’ivyo muvuga, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />maze ivyinyegeje mu mitima yabo bizobe bigiye ahabona. Bazoheza bakubite ibipfukamiro hasi bahimbaze Imana, bavuge bati: “Vy’ukuri Imana iri kumwe namwe!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibintu vyose bikwiye gukorwa mu rutonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Muri make rero bene Data, iyo mukoraniye hamwe, hazobe uwuririmba, uwundi yigishe, uwundi avuge ico Imana yamuhishuriye, uwundi avuge mu ndimi zitamenyekana, uwundi na we azisobanure. Ariko vyose bikorwe ku buryo bibubaka mwese. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Abantu nka babiri canke batatu gusa azobe ari bo bavuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana kandi havuge umwumwe, hongere habeho uwuzisobanura. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ata musobanuzi ahari, uwo muntu ntazovuge mu rusengero, azokwiganirire n’Imana wenyene.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Abantu nka babiri canke batatu bazotange ubuvugishwa, abandi na bo basese, bihweze ivyavuzwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Nimba hari uwicaye mu rusengero hanyuma akagira ico abwiwe n’Umwami Imana, uwari asanzwe ariko aravuga azoce abanza ahagarike. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Abavugishwa n’Imana bose bazokuranwa kuvuga, umwe avuge uwundi ahejeje, kugira mugire ico mutahuye hanyuma muterwe intege. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Abavugishwa n’Imana bategerezwa kuganza impwemu zabo, bagakuranwa kuvuga, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />kuko Imana yacu atari Imana y’akajagari, ariko ari Imana y’amahoro, nk’uko bigenda mu mashengero yose y’abera.<verse eid="1CO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />Abagore bazogume banumye mu makoraniro y’ishengero. Si vyiza ko bavuga, ahubwo bicishe bugufi nk’uko ivyagezwe bivuga. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Bafise ico bagomba kubaza, bazokibarize abagabo babo i muhira. Kuko bitabereye ko umugore avuga mu makoraniro y’ishengero.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Mbega ijambo ry’Imana ryamutse muri mwebwe Abakorinto? Canke mwibaza ko ari mwebwe mwenyene ryahawe? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Nimba muri mwebwe hari uwibwira ko ari umuvugishwa n’Imana canke afise ingabire za Mpwemu Yera, akwiye kwemera ko ivyo ndabandikiye ari ibwirizwa rivuye ku Mwami Imana. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Uwutavyemera, na we ntazokwemerwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />None rero bene Data, mwipfuze kuvugishwa n’Imana, kandi ntimubuze abavugishwa n’Imana mu ndimi zitamenyekana. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ariko vyose bikorwe mu buryo bubereye, kandi mu rutonde.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye n’ukuzuka kwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Ubu na ho bene Data, nagomba kubibutsa Ubutumwa Bwiza nababwiye, ubwo mwakiriye mukabugumamwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ubwo Butumwa ni bwo bubakiza hamwe mugumije amajambo nababwiye. Ahandi ho ukwizera kwanyu kwoba ari ukw’ubusa.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Kuko ivyo nahawe ari vyo nabashikirije nk’ivy’igiciro vya mbere: ko Kristo yapfiriye ivyaha vyacu, nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bibivuga, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />ko yahambwe hanyuma akazuka ku musi ugira gatatu nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bibivuga, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />kandi ko yiyeretse Kefa, hanyuma yiyereka bamwe cumi na babiri. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Inyuma yaho yiyerekera rimwe bene Data barenga amajana atanu, kandi n’aho benshi muri bo bamaze gupfa, bamwe muri bo baracariho. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Maze yiyereka Yakobo, yongera yiyereka n’izindi ntumwa zose, <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ubwa nyuma aranyiyereka nanje, nk’uwavutse igihe kitari co.<verse eid="1CO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Koko ndi uwa nyuma mu ntumwa kandi simbereye kwitwa intumwa, kuko nahamye ishengero ry’Imana. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ariko ndi uwo ndi kubera ubuntu bw’Imana, kandi ubwo buntu ntibwapfuye ubusa. Nakoze cane gusumba izindi ntumwa, ariko ntiyari jewe, bwari ubuntu bw’Imana bukorera muri jewe. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Ariko yaba jewe, yaba bo, ivyo ni vyo twigisha, kandi ni vyo mwizeye.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye n’ukuzuka kw’abapfuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />None rero nimba twigisha ko Kristo yazutse mu bapfuye, ni kubera iki bamwe muri mwebwe bavuga ko ukuzuka kw’abapfuye kutabaho? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Nimba ata kuzuka kw’abapfuye kubaho, na Kristo rero ntiyazutse. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Kandi nimba Kristo atazutse, inyigisho zacu ni iz’ubusa, kandi n’ukwizera kwanyu ni ukw’ubusa. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kandi ikirengeye ivyo, twebwe intumwa twoba tubeshera Imana, kuko twama dushinga intahe ko Imana yazuye Kristo mu bapfuye. Ariko nimba Imana itamuzuye mu bapfuye, koko nta kuzuka kw’abapfuye kubaho. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Kandi nimba abapfuye batazozurwa, na Kristo ntiyazuwe mu bapfuye. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Nimba na ho Kristo atazutse, ukwizera kwanyu ni ukw’ubusa, muracagendera mu vyaha vyanyu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Mbere n’abapfiriye muri Kristo ntibazosubira kubaho. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Nimba ivyizigiro vyacu muri Kristo ari ivy’ubu buzima gusa, turi abahombe gusumba abandi bantu bose.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ariko koko Kristo yarazutse mu bapfuye, amera kurya kw’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi, aba icemeza ko abapfuye bazozuka. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Nk’uko urupfu rwazanywe n’umuntu, n’ukuzuka kw’abapfuye na kwo kwazanywe n’umuntu. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Nk’uko muri Adamu bose bapfuye, muri Kristo bose bazogirwa bazima. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ariko hazoba urukurikirane mu kuzuka: Kristo yarazutse nk’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi; hanyuma abamukurikiye bose bazozuka niyagaruka. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Inyuma y’aho hazoca haza umuhero wa vyose, aho azotanga Ubwami akabushikiriza Imana Data, amaze gusangangura ububasha bwose, ubutware bwose n’ubushobozi bwose. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kuko ategerezwa kuganza gushitsa ashize abansi biwe musi y’ibirenge vyiwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Umwansi azosangangurwa ubwa nyuma ni rupfu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Kuko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga biti: “Imana yashize vyose musi y’ububasha bwiwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Zaburi 8:6</ref></char></char></note> Ariko rero iyo bivuze ko “vyose” biri musi y’ububasha bwiwe, biragaragara ko bitaba bishizemwo n’Imana kuko ni yo ishira vyose musi y’ububasha bwa Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Maze vyose nivyamara gushirwa musi y’ububasha bwa Kristo, na we azoja musi y’ububasha bw’Imana yashize vyose musi y’ububasha bw’Umwana wayo, Imana na yo hejuru ya vyose muri vyose.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Nimba ata zuka ririho, none abo babatizwa mu kibanza c’abapfuye babigira biteze iki? Nimba abapfuye batazozuka, ni kubera iki hari ababatizwa mu kibanza cabo? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Kandi ni kubera iki natwe twishira mu ntambara umwanya wose? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Bene Data, ndababwije ukuri ko mpakwa kwicwa ku musi ku musi. Ibi ni ukuri bimeze nk’umunezero mfise kubera ivyo Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo yakoze muri mwebwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Nimba naragwanye n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba muri Efeso, ata yindi nyungu niteze atari ivyizigiro vyo mu mubiri gusa, nzoba nungutse iki? Kandi nimba ata kuzuka kuriho, nk’uko wa mugani uvuga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">“Reka twirire twongere twinywere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">kuko ejo tuzopfa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Yesaya 22:13</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Ntihagire uwubazimiza: “Abagenzi babi bonona ingeso nziza z’umuntu.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Garura ubwenge nk’uko bibereye, mureke kwama mukora ivyaha. Ibi ndabivuze kugira ngo ndabatere kugira isoni, kuko bamwe muri mwebwe bataramenya Imana na gato.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imibiri tuzozukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Ariko bamwe muri mwebwe barabaza bati: “Mbega abapfuye bozozuka gute? Bazoba bafise umubiri umeze gute?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Mwa mburabwenge mwe! Imbuto ntishobora kumera itabanje gupfa. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Ico mubiba si urya mutumba w’igiterwa ukura, ahubwo ni imbuto zisanzwe, zaba ingano canke izindi mbuto. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Hanyuma Imana ikayiha umutumba nk’uko yabiteguye, kandi igatanga imitumba itandukanye bivanye n’imbuto. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Imibiri yose ntimeze co kimwe: abantu bafise imibiri yabo, ibikoko bikagira iyavyo, inyoni zikagira iyazo, n’amafi akagira iyayo. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Hari ibiba mu kirere, hakaba n’ibiba kw’isi, ariko ibiba mu kirere bifise ugukayangana kwavyo, ivyo kw’isi bikagira ugukayangana kwavyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Izuba rigira ugukayangana kwaryo, ukwezi kukagira ugukayangana kwakwo, inyenyeri na zo zikagira ugukayangana kwazo, kandi n’inyenyeri ubwazo zigira ugukayangana gutandukanye.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ni ko bizoba bimeze ku musi w’izuka ry’abapfuye. Uwu mubiri uhambwa ni uwubora, ariko uzozurirwa kubaho ibihe vyose. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Imibiri yacu ihambwa ata co imaze, ariko izozurirwa ubwiza butangaje. Ihambwa ari iminyantegenke ariko izozurirwa kuba inyenkomezi. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Ihambwa ari imibiri y’abantu nk’uko tuyibona, ariko izozurwa ari imibiri yo mu buryo bw’impwemu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 15:44">Kuko nk’uko hari imibiri isanzwe, hariho n’imibiri yo mu buryo bw’impwemu. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: “Umuntu wa mbere, ari we Adamu, yabaye uwufise ubuzima,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Itanguriro 2:7</ref></char></char></note> Adamu wa nyuma, ari we Kristo yaje ari Impwemu itanga ubugingo. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Uw’impwemu si we yaje ubwa mbere, habanje kuza uw’umubiri, hanyuma haza uw’impwemu. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Umuntu wa mbere, ari we Adamu, yavuye mw’ivu, uwo hanyuma, ni we Kristo, yavuye mw’ijuru. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Ab’isi bameze nk’uwo mu muntu w’isi, ariko abo mw’ijuru bameze nk’uwo muntu wo mw’ijuru. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Kandi nk’uko twavutse dufise kamere muntu k’abo kw’isi, ni ko tuzoba dufise kamere k’abo mw’ijuru.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Ico ngomba kubabwira bene Data, ni uko uwu mubiri twambaye utazoragwa Ubwami bw’Imana, kandi ibibora vyose ntibizoragwa ibihoraho. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Ariko reka ndababwire ibanga rihambaye: ntituzopfa, ahubwo tuzohindurwa ukundi. <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />Bizoba mu kanya isase, nk’uwukubise urugohe, igihe inzamba izovuga. Niyavuga abazoba barapfuye bazoca bazukira kubaho ibihe vyose. Natwe tuzoba tukiri bazima, tuzoca duhindurwa ukundi. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Uyu mubiri wacu ubora uzoca wambara ukutabora, kandi uwu mubiri wacu upfa uzoca wambara ukudapfa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Maze uwu mubiri ubora umaze kwambara ukutabora, n’ugupfa kwawo kukambara ukudapfa, ni ho ibi vyanditswe bizoba bishitse, ngo: “Urupfu rwamizwe n’intsinzi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Yesaya 25:8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Wa rupfu we, intsinzi yawe iri hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Wa rupfu we, uruboyi rwawe ruri he?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hoseya 13:14</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Kuko icaha ni uruboyi ruzana urupfu, kandi ubushobozi bw’icaha buri mu vyagezwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ariko Imana ishimwe, kuko iduha intsinzi muri Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />None bene Data nkunda, mushikame ntihagire ikibanyiganyiza. Mwiyegurire imisi yose gukorera Umwami wacu kuko muzi neza ko ibikorwa vyanyu atari impfagusa mu Mwami.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Gufasha abera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Ku bijanye no kwegeranya uburyo bwo gufasha abizera b’i Yerusalemu, mubikore nk’uko nabihanuye amashengero y’i Galatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Ku musi wa mbere w’indwi, umwe wese muri mwebwe arabika amahera ku yo yungutse. Ntimuzorindire ko nshika hiyo hanyuma ngo muce muyatoreza rimwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ninashika hiyo, nzokwandika amakete nzorungikana abo muzoba mwatoranije kugira batware imfashanyo zanyu i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Kandi nivyaba nkenerwa ko njana na bo, bazomperekeza.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’ukugendera ishengero ry’i Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Nzobagendera mvuye i Makedoniya kuko nipfuza gucayo. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Ndashobora kuzomarana namwe igihe, mbere nshobora kuhamara igihe c’imbeho nyinshi cane, kugira ngo muzomfashe ku bijanye no kubandanya urugendo, iyo nzoba ngiye hose. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Sinshaka kuhaca ndengana, nipfuza kumarana namwe umwanya ukwiye Umwami Imana abikunze. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Ariko mu kurindira nzoba ndagumye aha muri Efeso gushitsa ku musi wa Pentekote, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />kuko hariho akaryo keza ko gukorera Imana naho hari abangwanya benshi.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Timoteyo niyashika hiyo, muzomwakire neza kugira agubwe neza muri mwebwe, kuko ariko akora igikorwa c’Umwami co kimwe nanje. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Ntihazogire uwumugaya, ahubwo mumuhezagize ibikenewe mu rugendo rwiwe agarutse. Twe na bene Data tumurindiranye igishika.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Ku vyerekeye mwene Data Apolo na we, naramwinginze ngo azanane n’abandi bene Data iwanyu, ariko ntiyipfuje kuza ubwo nyene, azoza niyaronka akaryo keza.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Mube maso, mushikame mu kwizera, mube abagabo, mugire umwete, mugire umutima rugabo. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Ivyo mukora vyose mubikore mu rukundo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Murazi ko abo mu muryango wa Setefana ari bo bizeye ubwa mbere muri Akaya, baca bihebera gukorera abizera: ndabinginze rero bene Data, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />ngo murongorwe n’abantu nka bo, canke n’abifatanije na bo muri ico gikorwa. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Naranezerewe cane numvise ko Setefana, Forotunate na Akayiko bashitse ngaha. Bamfashishije ivyo nari nkeneye vyose mu kibanza canyu. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Baranteye intege nk’uko babateye intege. Abantu nk’abo ni abo gushimira ku bw’ibikorwa vyiza bakora.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Amashengero yo muri Aziya arabatasha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:19">Akwilasi na Pirisila na bo barabatasha cane mu Mwami, co kimwe n’ishengero rikoranira mu nzu yabo.<verse eid="1CO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Bene Data bose turi kumwe hano barabatasha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Muramukanye mu kugumbirana kwera.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Jewe Pawulo, ndabandikiye ndabatasha n’ukuboko kwanje.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Nimba hariho uwudakunda Umwami, uwo aravumwe. Kaze Mwami!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu bubane namwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ndabakunda mwese muri Kristo Yesu. Amen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>